	"descriptionMarkdown": "-Aquilo capable ship, travels at 258 km/s\n\n-Produces more than enough bullets and rockets, relies on an internal storage buffer.\n\n-Bottle-necked by fuel production (can make full trip to or from Aquilo to Nauvis, but immediate round trip may slow down)\n\n-Fuel production can be sped up at the cost of energy consumption (sometimes power satisfaction drops to around 80% in orbit above Aquilo)\n\n-Requires quite a while to saturate rocket belts if in orbit above Nauvis (I recommend traveling to and from Vulcanus a few times once bullets are full)\n\n-Efficiency modules 3 can be used instead of 2 if you want.\n\n-NOTE!!!: UPPER ROUNDABOUT BELT FOR CARBON AND SULFUR DEADLOCKS ON CARBON UPON FIRST START UP!!! When this happens, remove the carbon trasher inserter's enable/disable for a few seconds, then turn it back on and the belt should balance.\n\nPlease leave me any recommendations :)",
